# Expense and Travel Policy

## Submitting expenses

Expense claims must be submitted within 30 days of the purchase. Receipts are required for every expense above Rs 500. Claims are reimbursed within 10 working days of approval.

## Approval limits

Managers can approve claims up to Rs 50,000. Anything above that amount needs director approval.

## Business travel

Book economy class for all flights. Hotel stays are capped at Rs 8,000 per night in metro cities and Rs 5,000 per night elsewhere. The daily meal allowance while travelling is Rs 1,500.

Use the company travel portal for bookings so that invoices are automatically matched. Personal expenses, alcohol and fines are never reimbursable.
